B.a51=new A.r_("Diving Reflex","Submerging your face in cold water (or splashing it) triggers the mammalian diving reflex \u2014 your heart rate slows within seconds. It is one of the fastest calming signals your body responds to.","Fill a bowl or sink with cold water. Hold your breath and submerge your face for 15-30 seconds, or splash cold water repeatedly over your face and forehead.",B.p8,30)
